\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Weaker but outperform yen.  \b0\par\par\uc2 603 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 09:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, March 5 (Reuters) - Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakened\par slightly on Friday ahead of key U.S. jobs data but outperformed\par the yen, which was undermined by wariness of Japanese\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar        hit a three-month low of 1.7190\par per dollar on Thursday but found some support during Asian\par trading.\par     The Korean won        and Taiwan dollar          were\par slightly weaker but supported by foreign equity investment\par inflows. Markets in Thailand were closed.\par  \par     Analysts said the yen       , pinned near four-month lows\par around 111.30/40 per dollar and down nearly six percent from\par 3-=   year highs struck last month, had room to fall further\par and that could keep Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  under some pressure.\par     "Technically the yen is looking at 112.75 as the next\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 hurdle and that means there could be a further fallout on Asian  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Claudio Piron, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist with  \par \par \uc2 Standard Chartered Bank.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Markets were hoping the U.S. non-farm jobs data would help\par determine if the dollar was set for further gains.\par     Piron said he believed the dollar's rally was temporary and\par not a reversal in its longer term downtrend.\par     CROSSES\par     Yen/Asia cross rates showed regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were\par treating their Japanese counterpart's decline lightly and\par traders recommended buying the regionals against the yen.\par     "When dollar/yen goes up, yen/Asia goes down and Asian\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will outperform the yen when the yen is falling,"  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 said David Simmonds, a markets strategist with the Royal Bank  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of Scotland.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Sing dollar/yen cross was at 64.85 yen, the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 strongest the Sing dollar has been against the yen since  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 September. The Taiwan dollar/yen cross showed the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Taiwan dollar yielding about 3.34 yen, the highest since  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 September.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Simmonds said the trend was reminiscent of the yen's big  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 fall after a prolonged rally against the dollar towards the end  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of 1999, when foreign equity flows and a strong growth outlook  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 propped up Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and helped them outperform the yen.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RUPIAH WEAK  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Indonesian rupiah hit a four-month low near  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 8,590 per dollar but the decline was checked by expectations of  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 inflows from a $1.0 billion sovereign bond issue and a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 suspicion that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was selling dollars.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Still, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has fallen 2.5 percent since early  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 February and is being undermined by worries over upcoming  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 parliamentary and presidential elections that start in April  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and could last till September, if a presidential run-off is  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 required.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The one major overhang is the election process in  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Indonesia," said M.R.Madhavan, regional strategist with Bank of  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 America. "The elections in Indonesia are much more closely  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 fought and volatile. It is also a long process and that gives  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rise to a lot of uncertainty."  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  Change on the day at   0824 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       111.20         110.16       -0.94\par  Sing dlr        1.7170         1.7093       -0.45\par  Taiwan dlr      33.401         33.340       -0.18\par  Korean won     1172.70        1170.10       -0.22\par  Baht             39.45          39.41       -0.10\par  Peso             56.35          56.24       -0.19\par  Rupiah         8582.00        8540.00       -0.49\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       111.20         107.31       -3.50\par  Sing dlr        1.7170         1.6978       -1.12\par  Taiwan dlr      33.401         33.978       +1.73\par  Korean won     1172.70        1192.00       +1.65\par  Baht             39.45          39.59       +0.34\par  Peso             56.35          55.49       -1.52\par  Rupiah         8582.00        8410.00       -2.00.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040305e035001bt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
