\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Strong despite suspected  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 787 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 2004\par 10:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Ovais Subhani\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Jan 6 (Reuters) - Asian regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rose\par against the U.S. dollar on Tuesday, even as suspicion grew that\par central banks were in the market to restrict further gains.\par     The Singapore dollar        traded in a narrow range just\par shy of a 44-month peak of 1.6970 per dollar hit on Monday. The\par Thai baht , Taiwan dollar  and Indonesian rupiah\par   traded near highs last seen in mid-October and the South\par Korean won  touched three-week highs.\par  \par     The region-wide bullishness also helped the troubled\par Philippine peso  to a two-month high of 55.06 per dollar.\par     "It seemed like the peso was lifted with the regional\par tide," said Rovic De Guzman, head of trading at Union Bank of\par the Philippines.\par     Dealers in Manila said as the peso rose above the 55.15\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 level, where most corporate dollar buying orders were placed,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 players scrambled to get out of short dollar positions and in  \par \par \uc2 the process pushed the peso higher.  \par \par \uc2 The peso was Asia's worst performer in 2003, giving up  \par \par \uc2 about four percent of its value against the dollar on worries  \par \par \uc2 about the economic and political outlook of the Philippines.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said with the dollar now hitting fresh lows against   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the euro  almost daily, and with the yen        around\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 September 2000 highs, Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were set to rise  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 further.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TRADE-WEIGHTED WEAKNESS  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Another suspected \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the Bank of Japan, after  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 one on Monday, only helped to pull the yen slightly away from  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the 106 level and had a modest impact on regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Analysts said on a trade-weighted basis most Asian  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  should have weakened because most of them have  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 lagged gains in other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  versus the dollar.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Jimmy Koh, head of research at Singapore's UOB Bank said  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 that despite the Sing dollar's recent gains, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 still more than one percent weaker from the mid-point of the  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's trade-weighted policy band.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Thio Chin Loo, an analyst at BNP Paribas said that meant  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  players would continue to build long Sing dollar  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 positions against the U.S. dollar.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "This only means that the Sing dollar has room to  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 appreciate on a nominal basis against a universally weak  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar," she said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Dealers said the most aggressive players in the market were  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 offshore investment banks and funds bidding almost all Asian  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  higher against the dollar.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "People believe that the U.S. is very happy with the weak  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar situation and the Europeans and Japanese are not  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 opposing it sufficiently so until they see things prove  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 otherwise they are going to continue selling the dollar," said  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Simon Flint, strategist at Bank of America in Singapore.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Dealers said U.S. dollar purchases by some local or  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 state-run banks in Singapore, Thailand, Taiwan and Korea early  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Tuesday had raised suspicion that central banks were trying  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to manage the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gains.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 YUAN SPECULATION  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's announcement that it had pumped $45 billion into  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 two of its debt-ridden state banks had no impact on the yuan  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 or other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets in the region.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The transaction was made late last year and analysts said  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 it probably involved a direct transfer of assets from the  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's reserves without any \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  exchanges.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Speculation that China would this year allow some  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 appreciation of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which is virtually pegged to the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar at around 8.3 yuan, pushed the U.S. dollar discount on  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 one-year non-deliverable forwards to near record  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 levels at above 5,000 points - implying a yuan rate of 7.7780  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 per dollar.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Flint said the weakening U.S. dollar would continue to fuel  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 speculation of a yuan revaluation. However, he said any  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 appreciation of the yuan would be modest and sometime in the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 third quarter of this year.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     .\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR Change on the day 0840 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       106.24         106.96       +0.68\par  Sing dlr        1.6992         1.7003       +0.06\par  Taiwan dlr      33.825         33.900       +0.22\par  Korean won     1186.90        1192.00       +0.43\par  Baht             39.16          39.33       +0.43\par  Peso             55.10          55.27       +0.30\par  Rupiah         8330.00        8388.00       +0.70\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       106.24         107.01       +0.72\par  Sing dlr        1.6992         1.7014       +0.13\par  Taiwan dlr      33.825         34.050       +0.67\par  Korean won     1186.90        1197.90       +0.93\par  Baht             39.16          39.59       +1.10\par  Peso             55.10          55.50       +0.73\par  Rupiah         8330.00        8460.00       +1.56.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040106e016002hs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
