 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par  \par  - Thai baht  a shade higher within its listless\par ranges, quoted at 39.87/90.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031204dzc40008k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
