\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore dlr, baht ease off G7-inspired highs.  \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 2003\par 03:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     0052 - The Singapore dollar        pulls back from over\par three-month highs hit on Monday, with focus on moves in the yen\par   and on fears of possible U.S. dollar-buying \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (MAS).\par     - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar eases to 1.7288 per U.S. dollar, off\par 1.7230, its strongest since June, but still higher than late\par Monday's 1.7323.\par     - Dealers say players seeking range to settle down after\par Monday's volatile trade in response to the Group of Seven's\par weekend call for flexible exchange rates.\par     - Dealers say market to adjust for the yen's retreat from\par near three-year highs against the dollar and to remain cautious\par on talk that the MAS called up banks late on Monday to check\par their positions in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\par     - Trading range for the day is likely to be within\par 1.7240-1.7290, with holiday in Tokyo likely to keep volumes\par down, a dealer at a local bank said.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     - Thai baht        trades at stronger side of 40 per dollar\par level, off an over three-year high of 39.90 hit on Monday.\par     - Dealers in Singapore say market likely to look for\par trading clues from moves in the yen and other regional\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     - Tarisa Watanagase, the Bank of Thailand's deputy\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 governor, said on Monday the bank had no intention of resisting  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 fundamental market forces pushing up the baht.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020030923dz9n000h1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
