\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Trapped in a policy bind.  \b0\par\par\uc2 606 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2003\par 05:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, Sept 16 (Reuters) - Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  crept\par higher on Tuesday, helped by a modestly higher yen and an\par irresolute U.S. dollar, but remained wary of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     Uncertainty over policy dominated trade. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par dollar  was pressured by worries over next month's\par monetary policy review, and Philippine markets debated whether\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would remove a six-month limit on forward peso\par contracts.\par     In Korea, markets wondered if the won\par would be allowed to rise beyond 1,170 per dollar as they\par awaited an inflow of $1.2 billion from U.S-based Lone Star\par Fund's investment in Korea Exchange Bank (04940.KS).\par     After Taiwan media reports suggested foreign institutional\par investors would be allowed to sell their holdings of Taiwan\par stocks overseas, markets there speculated whether that opening\par of equity markets would be accompanied by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par appreciation.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     And as the Thai baht        shied away from 40.50 in\par offshore deals and stayed a bit weaker, analysts said Asian\par dollar-buying \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would remain the hot topic heading\par into IMF and Group of Seven meetings on the weekend.\par     "Although \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  appears to be an ongoing short-run\par reality, the event calendar in the coming months would argue\par against expecting the status quo," Lehman Brothers said in a\par note, citing the weekend meetings and preparations for U.S.\par presidential elections next year.\par     Lehman said solid growth in China, the Japanese economic\par rebound, and the strong flow of foreign money into Asian\par equities justified bullishness on Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     "Better global growth expectations and rising equity\par markets have been part of the reasoning behind our pro-Asia\par view, it is hardly the only reason. Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are cheap\par and the Asian business cycle has been growing on its own for\par some time," the note said.\par     PRICING HIGHER TAIWAN DOLLAR\par     While the Taiwan dollar stayed near 34.10/12, a level it\par has struggled to rise past since early September, the\par non-deliverable forwards were pricing in a higher \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The one-year premium on the Taiwan dollar           was\par quoted at 57 points, the highest in 14 months and pricing the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  up 1.7 percent in a year.\par     "The Taiwan dollar will appreciate over coming months, and\par potentially much more strongly than we have been used to seeing\par it for a long period," said David Simmonds, markets strategist\par at the Royal Bank of Scotland.\par     "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will remain cautious about \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gains\par and competitiveness pending direct, tangible evidence that\par stronger economic recovery is here," he said.\par     Other factors, such as whether Japan would ease its policy\par of yen-selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy, would\par also play a big role in influencing Taiwan's policymakers, he\par said. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR AT 0235 GMT\par  Change on the day\par  \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.17       117.57         +0.34\par  Sing dlr      1.7503       1.7524         +0.12\par  Taiwan dlr    34.127       34.147         +0.06\par  Korean won   1171.50      1172.60         +0.09\par  Baht           40.56        40.66         +0.25\par  Peso           55.00        54.97         -0.05\par  Rupiah       8458.00      8460.00         +0.02\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.17       118.74         +1.34\par  Sing dlr      1.7503       1.7341         -0.93\par  Taiwan dlr    34.127       34.753         +1.83\par  Korean won   1171.50      1185.80         +1.22\par  Baht           40.56        43.08         +6.21\par  Peso           55.00        53.38         -2.95\par  Rupiah       8458.00      8940.00         +5.70.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020030916dz9g000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
