\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Pressured by Korea talks,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  fears. \b0\par\par\uc2 625 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 2003\par 11:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Aug 29 (Reuters) - Barring the Taiwan dollar,\par most Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  disregarded a rising Japanese yen on\par Friday and were either steady to lower.\par     As the yen reached a six-week high against the dollar,\par after Japanese data showed improving industrial output and the\par Nikkei rose, the Taiwan dollar neared its highest in a year.\par     The Korean won suffered from worries as six-nation talks in\par China over North Korea's nuclear crisis ended inconclusively,\par with the delegates agreeing to meet again in October and\par Pyongyang highly critical of the U.S. stance.\par  \par     Worries the Bank of Korea was still \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to contain\par won appreciation also pushed the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  down against the yen.\par     The Thai baht too was haunted by the fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par forcing it to halt a three-week uptrend. The Bank of Thailand\par hinted on Thursday it had been \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     On Friday, Thai \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor,  Pridiyathorn\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Devakula, said the bank was monitoring speculative flows \par \par \uc2  betting on the baht's rise and would find ways to deal with \par \par \uc2  them. \par \par \uc2  "The uncertainties inherent in the (Korea) talks represent \par \par \uc2  one set of reasons why, though we like baht and Taiwan dollar \par \par \uc2  in reflecting the global reflation trade, we are more wary of \par \par \uc2  won," Bank of America said in their commentary. \par \par \uc2  "Bank of Thailand launched another salvo against \par \par \uc2  speculation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This makes sense in the context of \par \par \uc2  them wishing to limit baht appreciation as a result of \par \par \uc2  speculation," it said. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar fell as it moved towards the centre of \par \par \uc2  the trade-weighted band authorities manage the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in, a \par \par \uc2  day after the authorities announced cuts to employer \par \par \uc2  contributions to the country's pension system. \par \par \uc2  RUPIAH WEAK AFTER RATE CUTS \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian rupiah recovered from two-week lows towards \par \par \uc2  afternoon after falling under the pressure of month-end imports \par \par \uc2  and market expectations that falling interest rates will erode \par \par \uc2  its attractiveness to investors. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut overnight rates on Friday, the seventh \par \par \uc2  time since May and said it saw no need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend \par \par \uc2  the rupiah. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Vincent Low, markets strategist at Merrill Lynch, said the\par rate cut ought to impact the rupiah adversely.\par     But Low disagreed with some economists who suggest\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesia ought to be less aggressive in cutting rates and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par should focus on attracting investment and building \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves as it prepares to exit an IMF funding\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par programme.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "I'm not sure about using the exchange rate as a stimulus\par in a closed economy like Indonesia," Low said.\par     "Interest rates are a more direct way for macro economic\par objectives, and the way to build reserves is not through\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  but by looking for alternative sources to the\par IMF."     The Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was comfortable with some\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par weakness in the rupiah, which has been one of Asia's best\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par performers this year, and other than politics, Indonesia's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par economic fundamentals were sound, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Elsewhere, the Philippine peso was back on the weaker side\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of 55, after having closed above that level for the first time\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in 10 days on Thursday and despite the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's remark it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par expected the peso around 54 per dollar at the end of 2003.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The country's Defence Secretary Angelo Reyes said on Friday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par he was resigning in the wake of the July 27 failed mutiny, and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par warned of a well-funded plot to bring down the government.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso had rallied over the past two days from near\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par record lows after a government warning and a slight monetary\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par tightening.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  announced on Thursday after the market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par closed that it was scrapping a tiered system on overnight\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par borrowing that discouraged banks from making larger deposits\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030829dz8t00hws\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
