\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Baht succumbs to  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  fears. \b0\par\par\uc2 635 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 2003\par 11:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Aug 28 (Reuters) - The Thai baht       , among\par the only Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to have escaped \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  anxiety\par in a sharp three-week rally, pared gains on Thursday after the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hinted it had moved to contain the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par appreciation.\par     The threat of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by central banks hung around\par other regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , preventing them from gaining on\par continuing foreign investment inflows and relative growth\par prospects.\par     The baht        rose to a 13-month high of 41.07, boosted\par by Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra's remarks that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  could do little to curb the rallying baht in the past\par week.\par     It pared gains after Bank of Thailand director Chakramon\par Phasukvanich said the bank was monitoring the baht and had\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Some traders suspected the BOT bought dollars.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "The Thai baht was the only \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  that continued to move\par down over the last couple of days, so I am not surprised," said\par James Malcolm, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist with JP Morgan.\par     But, despite worries that the market was getting too long\par the baht, traders had hesitated positioning against the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     Besides strong exports and domestic consumption, Thailand\par has seen foreign portfolio investment of a net 19.04 billion\par baht of Thai stocks so far, 33 percent more than in all of\par 2002.\par  \par     UBS said the Bank of Thailand (BoT) had allowed the baht to\par effectively appreciate four percent since May.\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  measures to allow more capital outflows have\par not reined in the bullishness on the baht.\par     On Thursday, traders were sure the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would hit 41 in\par the next few sessions.\par     BULLISH ON ASIA\par     The rupiah        was the region's weakest \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par falling over half a percent to 8,530 to the dollar on talk of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par demand for dollars from an oil firm and covering of stop-losses\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par triggered by the drop past 8,480.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But, amid expectations of positive U.S. data later this\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par week and fears of Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , local traders were\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par betting Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would rise soon.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "On a medium-term outlook, we would still be comfortable\par recommending long Asia, short dollar trades," Malcolm said.\par     The Singapore dollar        was off Wednesday's two-week\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lows but stayed on the weaker side of 1.75 as Prime Minister\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Goh Chok Tong announced a cut in employer contributions to the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par city state's pension scheme and said a consumption tax hike due\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on January 1 would be implemented as scheduled.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Philippine peso  closed on the firmer side of 55\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for the first time in two weeks, extending a rebound from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 31-month lows after Wednesday's warning by authorities against\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par speculation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  pressures on the won\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   subsided, although traders suspected the Bank of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Korea was still vigilant and would step in if the won tried to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par firm past 1,170 again.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar  was virtually unchanged, torn\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par between the weakening won and a rising domestic share market.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR AT 0830 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.46       117.66         +0.17\par  Sing dlr      1.7539       1.7549         +0.06\par  Taiwan dlr    34.210       34.209         -0.00\par  Korean won   1178.00      1177.50         -0.04\par  Baht           41.20        41.30         +0.24\par  Peso           54.93        55.33         +0.73\par  Rupiah       8505.00      8457.00         -0.56\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     117.46       118.74         +1